This is the result of a bug in the particular djgpp compiler version used 
to build your NetHack executable, not because of a bug in NetHack.  
Either obtain the official binary from linc.cis.upenn.edu , or rebuild 
NetHack with the _latest_ version of the djgpp compiler.


